WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.314
Welcome to OurWater.

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:08.722
After this video you will know your way around: the
menu, Easy and Advanced, your account,

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:12.346
and your language, on a computer and on a
phone.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.046
This is OurWater.

00:00:15.166 --> 00:00:18.478
The dark blue menu on the left gets you
everywhere.

00:00:18.598 --> 00:00:22.150
At its top, the logo always takes you Home.

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:26.079
Below the logo is the station type chooser.

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:31.431
It says All types, so you see wells, rain
gauges, ponds and more.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.010
Pick one kind to narrow things down.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.002
I chose Rainfall.

00:00:37.817 --> 00:00:42.977
Home now says Showing Rainfall only, and the
map shows just the rain gauges.

00:00:43.097 --> 00:00:45.641
Your lists narrow the same way.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.546
Choose All types to see everything again.

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:53.530
It only changes what you see, never what you
may do.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:57.374
Under it is the Easy and Advanced switch.

00:00:57.494 --> 00:01:01.310
We are in Easy, the short menu for a normal
day.

00:01:02.117 --> 00:01:08.021
Home is your starting page, with your stations
on a map and big buttons for everyday jobs.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:11.754
Add a measurement is the one you will use
most.

00:01:11.874 --> 00:01:14.874
It opens the form for recording what you saw.

00:01:15.683 --> 00:01:18.515
My stations lists your water points.

00:01:18.635 --> 00:01:22.355
Search it, open one, or add a new station.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:28.727
My measurements lists everything you have recorded,
so you can search it and fix a mistake.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:35.214
My weather shows the forecast and recent rain
for any place, so you can plan your day.

00:01:36.017 --> 00:01:39.665
My station map opens the map on your own
stations.

00:01:39.785 --> 00:01:42.569
One tap on the page adds everyone's.

00:01:43.383 --> 00:01:45.375
At the bottom is Account.

00:01:45.495 --> 00:01:48.927
It starts folded, so click its name to open
it.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:55.198
Profile is about you: your name, picture,
country and password.

00:01:56.017 --> 00:01:59.209
Favourites is your shortlist of starred
stations.

00:01:59.329 --> 00:02:03.313
Recent activity takes you back to stations you
opened lately.

00:02:04.117 --> 00:02:10.069
My team is where you join neighbours, so everyone in
the team can record at the team's stations.

00:02:10.883 --> 00:02:15.419
Requests is for asking for, and sharing,
station data.

00:02:15.539 --> 00:02:20.003
Messages is your mailbox, with a small number
when something waits.

00:02:20.817 --> 00:02:27.105
Settings is where you choose your language,
look, text size, units and usual place.

00:02:27.917 --> 00:02:30.509
Support sends feedback to the team.

00:02:30.629 --> 00:02:33.413
About OurWater says who made the app.

00:02:33.533 --> 00:02:36.197
Learn about water has short lessons.

00:02:37.017 --> 00:02:39.633
Click Advanced and the menu grows.

00:02:39.753 --> 00:02:42.561
Nothing you use every day goes away.

00:02:42.681 --> 00:02:44.937
Advanced only adds more.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:52.542
My monitoring keeps your everyday jobs: adding
measurements, your stations, your weather and your map.

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:58.054
All monitoring data looks beyond your own
stations: the Monitoring map,

00:02:58.174 --> 00:03:01.366
and charts and tables of how water changes.

00:03:02.183 --> 00:03:08.063
Advanced analytics has the chart builder, and the
Tool marketplace, a shelf of small helpers.

00:03:08.883 --> 00:03:10.827
Every heading folds.

00:03:10.947 --> 00:03:13.563
Click one and its links tuck away.

00:03:13.683 --> 00:03:16.683
OurWater remembers this on your device.

00:03:17.517 --> 00:03:19.389
Click again to open it.

00:03:19.509 --> 00:03:22.269
Switch back to Easy whenever you like.

00:03:22.389 --> 00:03:24.405
Your choice is saved.

00:03:25.217 --> 00:03:29.273
The round button with your initial, bottom
left, is you.

00:03:29.393 --> 00:03:36.689
It opens Profile, Settings, Theme, Design, and
Sign out in red, for shared devices.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:41.717
Theme chooses a light or dark screen, or
follows your device.

00:03:41.837 --> 00:03:44.693
Dark is easier on the eyes at night.

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:47.917
Design redraws the whole app.

00:03:48.037 --> 00:03:50.701
This is Plain, the quiet look.

00:03:50.821 --> 00:03:53.101
There are three painted looks too.

00:03:53.221 --> 00:03:55.765
The information never changes.

00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:58.935
Beside it is the language chip.

00:03:59.055 --> 00:04:00.927
Click it for the list.

00:04:01.047 --> 00:04:05.703
OurWater speaks more than sixty languages, and
the whole app changes.

00:04:06.517 --> 00:04:08.389
Need more room?

00:04:08.509 --> 00:04:12.133
The small double arrow at the top right of the
menu hides it.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.134
The page fills the screen.

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:18.926
The three-line button at the top left brings
the menu back.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.534
You can also change the menu's width.

00:04:22.654 --> 00:04:25.774
Drag its right edge, and the menu follows.

00:04:25.894 --> 00:04:28.750
OurWater remembers the size you like.

00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:35.319
The round teal button at the bottom right is the
OurWater Guru, a helper for the page you are on.

00:04:35.439 --> 00:04:37.479
It is on every page.

00:04:38.283 --> 00:04:40.491
Click it and a panel opens.

00:04:40.611 --> 00:04:43.587
Type a question, and the helper answers.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:47.009
That is the way around OurWater.

00:04:47.129 --> 00:04:50.105
Open any item in the menu and have a look.

00:04:50.225 --> 00:04:52.529
Looking cannot break anything.

00:04:52.649 --> 00:04:55.313
Thanks for helping look after our water.
